- {!Camlcast.Hook} — the slot machinery, and the one rule it enforces.
- {{!page-"building-the-engine"} {b Building the engine from scratch}} — how the
  picture is drawn and how the layer over it works, both rebuilt by hand with the
  derivations written out.
- [demo/] — twenty-two small worlds, one per feature, each short enough to read
  in a sitting.
